000788r 2  B5 rr            lda PlayerPX,x
00078Ar 2  38 E5 00         sub 0
00078Dr 2  4A               lsr
00078Er 2  4A               lsr
00078Fr 2  4A               lsr
000790r 2  4A               lsr
