000CEBr 2               
000CEBr 2  A5 rr          lda TouchTopA
000CEDr 2  E5 rr          sbc TouchTopB   ; Note will subtract n-1
000CEFr 2  E5 rr          sbc TouchTemp  ;#SIZE2-1
000CF1r 2  65 rr          adc TouchTemp2 ;#SIZE1+SIZE2-1 ; Carry set if overlap
000CF3r 2  90 02          bcc No
