000FFDr 2  96 96 20 20    .byt $96, $96, $20, $20 ; cycle on platform
001001r 2  DA DB EA EB    .byt $da, $db, $ea, $eb ; solid grass (left)
001005r 2  DB DB EB EB    .byt $db, $db, $eb, $eb ; solid grass (middle)
001009r 2  DB DC EB EC    .byt $db, $dc, $eb, $ec ; solid grass (right)
