003B28r 2               
003B28r 2  20 rr rr     : jsr ReadJoy
003B2Br 2  A5 rr          lda keydown
003B2Dr 2  05 rr          ora keydown+1
003B2Fr 2  05 rr          ora keydown+2
003B31r 2  05 rr          ora keydown+3
003B33r 2  D0 F3          bne :-
003B35r 2               
003B35r 2               Loop:
